          "Long Description",
          "This workshop will guide you through migrating a WebLogic Server domain from a pre-packaged 'on-premises' demo environment to OCI with the WebLogic Server stack from the Marketplace. The demo environment provides a simple set of applications: a static web app and a database-connected app to showcase the migration of a realistic environment. It makes use of the various tool to migrate the WebLogic domain, like WebLogic Deploy Tooling, as well as database migration tools (data pump)."
