          "Oracle Machine Learning Notebooks is a collaborative web-based interface that provides a development environment to create machine learning notebooks where you can perform data exploration and visualizations, data preparation and machine learning. Key features of Oracle Machine Learning Notebooks:\n*  Allows collaboration among data scientists, business and data analysts, application and dashboard developers, Database Administrators, and IT professionals.\n *  Leverages the scalability and performance of Oracle Platform and its Cloud Services.\n *  Provides SQL, PL/SQL, R, and Python paragraphs for using OML4SQL, OML4R, and OML4Py."
