          "Long Description",
          "In this workshop, learn how to use the new Fleet UI to automate patching of multiple Oracle Database targets using Oracle Enterprise Manager. This workshop is a fully functional Oracle Enterprise Manager environment configured to run predefined use cases against multiple Oracle Database targets. The workshop VM comes preinstalled with Enterprise Manager 13.5 and Oracle Database targets - 18.3, 18.8, 18.10, 19.3 and 19.10. Making it easy to deploy and startup an environment in ~20 minutes."
