          "Long Description",
          "The Siebel Cloud Manager is a new REST-based tool used for automating the deployment of Siebel CRM on Oracle Cloud Infrastructure, whether you start from the existing on-premises deployment of Siebel CRM or create a new deployment  on OCI.\nThis workshop showcases the deployment of a new Siebel CRM environment on Oracle Cloud Infrastructure (OCI) using the Siebel Cloud Manager where the Siebel CRM runs as Containers in Oracle Kubernetes Engine (OKE)."
