          "In this workshop learn how to monitor applications, technology stack and infrastructure, including compute, and network logs in a hybrid cloud environment using logs. See how to create KPIs and executive grade visualizations and dashboards. You will use advanced machine learning and analytics that reduces troubleshooting time and enables faster root cause analysis using an Oracle Integration Cloud workshop example.\n\nYou’ll be managing a live environment consisting of: multiple Kubernetes(OKE) clusters, with MySQL Heatwave, Oracle E-Business Suite, a pure cloud native e-commerce app on Autonomous Database, and number of other OCI IaaS Services in this lab."
