          "Long Description",
          "Oracle Database 23ai introduces a suite of powerful new Vector Database capabilities, including support for Vectors to store generative Al embedding models, Al Vector Similarity Search and powerful new AI Indexes. All these features are key to enabling RAG with your database data.\nThis workshop will show you how easy it is to create and use Vector embedding using Java.\nYou can choose from a variety of embedding models, including Cohere, and Open AI."
