          "Short Description",
          "The lab will help you to use OCI Enterprise AI Vector Stores with files formats like:\n- Video/Audio (MP3/MP4,...)\n- images (JPG/PNG,...)\n- Word/Excel/Powerpoint/....\n- Sitemap (Web site links)\n\nIt will also show user interface for such system using:\n- Oracle Digital Assistant\n- APEX\n- LangGraph\n- Enterprise AI Chat"
