          "Long Description",
          "This workshop walks through the \"Coherence Demonstration Application\", which is a fictitious stock application, which demonstrates general Coherence features, scalability capabilities including:\n\nClustering and Data Sharding\nScalability and High Availability\nDisk-Based Persistence\nParallel Queries\nEfficient Aggregation\nIn-Place Processing\nFederation (Grid Edition feature only)\nOpenTracing Support\nPolyglot client access from JavaScript, Python and Golang\nListening for events using Server Sent Events (SSE)"
